    "name": "UTOPIA : Node 17",
    "steam_appid": 3814020,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NODE 17</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >__________________________</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When they take your head, all that\u2019s left is a body.<br>But even a body can resist.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >They replaced the faces. We stayed behind in the snow.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the catastrophe that swept across the former USSR, people became obsolete.<br>Corporations subdued the survivors \u2014 embedding screens, tools, and weapons into their bodies.<br>They no longer think. Only execute.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are one of the few who still has a face.<br>You arrive at an abandoned camp \u2014 once home to children.<br>The snow never melts, the campfires barely keep the cold away, and the Doomed wander by command.<br>On the horizon \u2014 a sinister tower. Its nameplate reads: <strong>\u201cNode 17.\u201d</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You are a Memory Courier</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where everyone\u2019s head has been replaced with screens and tools, memory is contraband.<br>You are one of the last who can preserve and transfer memories.<br>You came to Node 17 not just to survive \u2014<br>You came to collect fragments of the past and deliver them to where they still matter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Memories are erased. Towers jam thoughts.<br>But as long as someone remembers \u2014 there is still something to fight for.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survival</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814020/extras/8f5187ce45bdf1e47d450a20815d773d.poster.avif?t=1749884059\" width=500 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814020/extras/8f5187ce45bdf1e47d450a20815d773d.webm?t=1749884059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814020/extras/8f5187ce45bdf1e47d450a20815d773d.mp4?t=1749884059\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Night. Cold. Fire \u2014 your only barrier between life and death.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light campfires. Find firewood. Build shelters.<br>Everything that isn\u2019t insulated is the enemy.<br>Watch your body heat and preserve your strength \u2014<br>In this world, death is just another instruction.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your Base. Your Hope.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every camp has a story. Some of them are tragic. One of them is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repair an old pickup. Find a battery, pour in some fuel, try to drive.<br>Or stay. And build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can craft structures and gather supplies.<br>You\u2019re not alone: in <strong>cooperative mode</strong>, you can survive together with friends.<br>(Though each player sees the camp a little differently...)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814020/extras/34c3937c258037f0e558c6b221f0862d.poster.avif?t=1749884059\" width=500 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814020/extras/34c3937c258037f0e558c6b221f0862d.webm?t=1749884059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814020/extras/34c3937c258037f0e558c6b221f0862d.mp4?t=1749884059\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >They\u2019re not dead. Just no longer human.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Doomed were once Workers, Teachers, Fathers, and Mothers.<br>Their heads were replaced with screens, grinders, welding torches.<br>They no longer feel. They don\u2019t think. They only run programs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shoot the screen \u2014 and you\u2019ll hear order flicker and die.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814020/extras/9766a33a63c74c78c4a266547952b517.poster.avif?t=1749884059\" width=500 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814020/extras/9766a33a63c74c78c4a266547952b517.webm?t=1749884059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814020/extras/9766a33a63c74c78c4a266547952b517.mp4?t=1749884059\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The road is survival too.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get in the truck. Turn on the lights. Drive into the night.<br>One drives. One shoots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In co-op, you divide the roles \u2014 one repairs, one defends, one builds fires.<br>But the most important thing \u2014 is never stop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814020/extras/8b568c9c7bed4f02f15beb945bc31ba9.poster.avif?t=1749884059\" width=500 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814020/extras/8b568c9c7bed4f02f15beb945bc31ba9.webm?t=1749884059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814020/extras/8b568c9c7bed4f02f15beb945bc31ba9.mp4?t=1749884059\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is Node 17 hiding?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll build, survive, gather \u2014 but sooner or later, you\u2019ll uncover pieces of the truth.<br>And then, you\u2019ll meet those who still guard it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And everything will become clear.<br>Or meaningless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive. Rebuild. Discover the truth.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Add to your wishlist.</strong><br>When the tower powers up \u2014 you\u2019ll want to be ready.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NODE 17</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >__________________________</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When they take your head, all that\u2019s left is a body.<br>But even a body can resist.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >They replaced the faces. We stayed behind in the snow.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the catastrophe that swept across the former USSR, people became obsolete.<br>Corporations subdued the survivors \u2014 embedding screens, tools, and weapons into their bodies.<br>They no longer think. Only execute.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are one of the few who still has a face.<br>You arrive at an abandoned camp \u2014 once home to children.<br>The snow never melts, the campfires barely keep the cold away, and the Doomed wander by command.<br>On the horizon \u2014 a sinister tower. Its nameplate reads: <strong>\u201cNode 17.\u201d</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You are a Memory Courier</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where everyone\u2019s head has been replaced with screens and tools, memory is contraband.<br>You are one of the last who can preserve and transfer memories.<br>You came to Node 17 not just to survive \u2014<br>You came to collect fragments of the past and deliver them to where they still matter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Memories are erased. Towers jam thoughts.<br>But as long as someone remembers \u2014 there is still something to fight for.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survival</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814020/extras/8f5187ce45bdf1e47d450a20815d773d.poster.avif?t=1749884059\" width=500 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814020/extras/8f5187ce45bdf1e47d450a20815d773d.webm?t=1749884059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/s