f the truth.<br>And then, you\u2019ll meet those who still guard it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And everything will become clear.<br>Or meaningless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive. Rebuild. Discover the truth.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Add to your wishlist.</strong><br>When the tower powers up \u2014 you\u2019ll want to be ready.</p>",
